gDShIt8PB5YQ7kNvwGwI-aA&_nc_oc=Adp1VLhxOJ2gZ5IC47rpjwVzs4i5M0HzrfcBOp6geBcWVT-o70TRLmUL4waDWrnNaZ0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS5RvEbvUfxX7j9D0pvSAQUVpzuGrsO4nHWHctKByxnZw&oe=6AF71B37"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vyFpUWsW2nMQ7kNvwE0BK_L&_nc_oc=AdqGtpRq4yljeL8Y4kKScaujtY2Hl3-rBKYj3zW_S8TQvvfDCJr33kZKCmZgOLqYMRY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSCT-Sku7iXH7eHCk-FhZ4Zyu51XYNJK8aeziW3E0OKzQ&oe=6AF71CCA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eCbuRBtmsx8Q7kNvwE2xFyn&_nc_oc=Adq1ho3SBIVx3W8MXMt_jPG2dmzX0Bs_1Zvt8aB7jlm9iNxdOd2LfYz-UZxpCxvmNCE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQusrBiIm4syoTEd6uzHFgxdfzxeeX-lOg-yXXcYj6SPw&oe=6AF7422F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BM3EWeskAt4Q7kNvwF1noFw&_nc_oc=Adq2t3LPSH-z3Z2vvt4Q1QgmUCTgcfUeQQ3s4aLBT1W3eN6eyPoLiATKxaQMk-Ct1VQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSMpRVo6i84smfBUsGdw7QOZXh6SJ_iNAwD3FruQpzwWg&oe=6AF72B83"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vh01-EitBHYQ7kNvwHj1zB2&_nc_oc=AdrnmJ-8EOsPZknRs_uNVEGeZd6-jbQpoEXCchPjp7u0FND1NxCgkMDDqc_3PU7wZww&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTjLu6znoVGPCorsiPFg-6Y7I56h35OPXxUUm5rhHRl8w&oe=6AF723D8"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KJnlYuyWxTUQ7kNvwH9V3tQ&_nc_oc=AdpBAj99SqF3ma8CCiVfGwQ5b9EMyOFeYZJ3l0k3QZkQ5ApnmWG8Ung0nGEJOAY5rSY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ8bGaCuGzprJXhdJ7Sik7iX-QXp3bAYcO_CcnkA8R2gQ&oe=6AF736FC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080